{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_title", "source_sha256": "7a5576938b24e1558c278ad7e5c914f8221546515b8f524695b3b7229562e1c3", "ja": "私の選択／彼方の希望", "zh": "我的选择／远方的希望", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bd0ab82be5b00f16ed830dfb4e082a7d7f5be5ed201cf67536d3fdb7c78cadfe", "ja": "番組の撮影で意に添わない内容を求められる\nアイドル達。このみは年長者として我慢する\nも、より過激な内容を要求される。落ち込む\nこのみだったが、プロデューサーや妹との\n会話を経て、自分らしさを取り戻していく。", "zh": "在节目录制中被要求配合不合心意内容的\n偶像们。歌织虽作为年长者选择忍耐，\n却被提出了更为过分的要求。歌织深感沮丧，\n但在与制作人以及妹妹交谈之后，\n逐渐找回了属于自己的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b494c13cad991c95faae60fe71488fb8e900c6de3ebff09c16c0b34da7b1b926", "ja": "（その後、改めて例の番組からオファーがあった。\n打ち合わせにはこのみさんも同席してもらう事にした）", "zh": "（之后，之前那个节目又发来了邀约。于是决定让木实小姐也一同出席商谈。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1001_director", "source_sha256": "21260e807312581a60b3de60e44c32a84a67f6d199a9d6f795244d57ddf8990c", "ja": "いや～、前回はありがとうございました！\n視聴率も、ネットの評判もなかなかで！", "zh": "哎呀～，上次真是太感谢了！\n收视率和网上的口碑都相当不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5355e747776ae78a9358e8d4c87db1379b279b82a39542d0d57c83aa8dee0d02", "ja": "ありがとうございます。ですが、水着衣装については、\n様々なご意見があったように見受けられます。", "zh": "非常感谢。不过，关于泳装造型，\n似乎也引起了各方面的不同意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5a22126b3bba886255177f4bbfd821d0c365e8ca90fa7b9d507d5c4a896b63e8", "ja": "うちのファンの方々は、お子さんや女性も多いです。\nグラビアなら、見る人の範囲を想定できますが……。", "zh": "我们这边的粉丝里，也有很多小孩子和女性。\n如果是拍写真，还能预估受众范围，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d3244e34b5192ab5259d6a4f875486c898d77e29f1fc71cfb5f0ea91e69d2e2e", "ja": "地上波では、それができません。\nなので、水着はお断りさせて頂こうと思います。", "zh": "在地面波电视上，就无法做到这一点了。\n所以，泳装的要求我们想回绝掉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1006_director", "source_sha256": "3e54e7194cf7d63b67109319bbb75ba609593419a36cd67cb81cfc5eb6fd14e9", "ja": "そうなんですかぁ！？　もったいない！　あーでも\n最近はコンプラがどうとか、うるさいですからねぇ。", "zh": "是这样吗！？太可惜了！啊，不过最近总有人念叨什么合规之类的，也挺烦人的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1007_director", "source_sha256": "31d077ff2d3b8cb97dca98d7df6616a2b9eb4d5830cb8baf35be640497694206", "ja": "もしかして、765さんも気にしてます？\nほら、フェミとかってやつ！", "zh": "难道说，765先生也很在意吗？\n就是女权什么的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1008_compositionartist", "source_sha256": "e24a552b4117ad08962afe876c01f3d7b1ce13eabb7df91b17f63c9843682062", "ja": "今、流行ってますからねえ、フェミ。\nSNSなんかでもうるさいですし……。", "zh": "现在正流行嘛，女权主义。社交媒体上也闹得沸沸扬扬的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "f73f449e18dc7c5cb6ac39b38289c01ac8383adcc3ab646b49f41ba196bdab4e", "ja": "え？　それは……。", "zh": "咦？那是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0875654fe53e25df52dc869a0896642ab5a44cb52ebd818fd19ec4b69721fe51", "ja": "……流行りとか、そういう事ではないです。\nそもそも、私共はアイドル事務所です。", "zh": "……这并不是什么流行与否的问题。\n归根结底，我们是偶像事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1011_p", "source_sha256": "53b7f8b08e126df1b14298d7d57febebfc39d1d9fae0c5473b3d5f7ae1ea8e66", "ja": "アイドルは自分自身が商品です。だからこそ、\nその意志や考えは尊重したいと思っています。", "zh": "偶像本身就是商品。正因如此，我希望尊重她们自己的意志和想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1012_p", "source_sha256": "af521648a962fdd64f1a6239b8ab05ed1c067c99dc93b4dd8ce01d793b6f4e49", "ja": "そして私共のお客さんは、アイドルを愛し、\nリスペクトしてくれるすべての人達です。", "zh": "而我们的客人，是所有热爱并尊重偶像的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0e315ce1d1511fd0fd06dfdba223f18eeedeb6c0702ef7fcd98c084971a5a284", "ja": "その人達が、不快になるような仕事はできない。\nそれだけです。", "zh": "不能接让那些人感到不快的工作。\n仅此而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1014_director", "source_sha256": "96146d443b419f01cb1e0fddfd984767167d1eec89ef83d1a14556c1c70c6a26", "ja": "そっか～、水着ダメか～。あ、なら今度は\nこういうのはどう！？　ドッキリ、ハプニング系！", "zh": "这样啊～，泳装不行啊～。啊，那下次试试这种怎么样！？整蛊、意外状况类型！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1015_compositionartist", "source_sha256": "75070323defd74210d0de2933f09cac80d67804a1d6f0757060d14fa129eb05b", "ja": "あ～いいですね！　楽屋で現役アイドルがガチ喧嘩！\n修羅場とか、見てみたいっスね～！", "zh": "啊～真不错呢！现役偶像在后台真刀真枪地吵架！\n像修罗场之类的，真想见识一下呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1016_director", "source_sha256": "4db505e54a93c3ca770c5464869b5ad7facc4bd379c661671ca6208248482f4e", "ja": "馬場さんが他のアイドルにガチギレするとか、\nいいんじゃないですか？　画的にも映えますし！", "zh": "让马场小姐真的对其他偶像大发雷霆之类的，不是挺好的吗？从画面效果来看也很出彩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "0208e859ee18a226bbf68a6c3ab8ea37be944d2f988fdb7df6a4e200ee151173", "ja": "っ……！", "zh": "唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1018_p", "source_sha256": "93bec5973ec048a81203a3dc2b9c6f912362d9b861db3733c229f9337babba90", "ja": "（前回の事もあるし、覚悟はしていたけど……\nこの感じでは、どうにも良い内容になりそうもないな）", "zh": "（考虑到上次的事，我也有所觉悟了，可照现在这个样子，实在不太可能会有好的结果）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3fe3d9108ddd045ba8b9cb67c1f93ca7ab8993850db8f749acac78ee73048a0d", "ja": "（やっぱり、今回は出演を断ろう。\nこのみさんに確認を……ん？）", "zh": "（果然，这次还是拒绝出演吧。先去跟此身小姐确认一下……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "49fd8d5cdc67417b0908a5e428e5e22ae3232834357b32ad39f59276563ee277", "ja": "あ、あの！\n私、そういうのは……！", "zh": "啊、那个！\n我、我不太擅长那种事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1021_p", "source_sha256": "851051c32eab7bbbb7f0e60d93891fa014fd309c8931fec315037f917264bf69", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、このみさん。", "zh": "没事的，木实小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a539719f5a6f40b227889e25b15a89bd48c2bb2acb5a6825bb3c7e32a4a4c520", "ja": "すみません。そういうのも、うちはNGなので。\nこれは765プロとしての見解、全体の判断です。", "zh": "对不起，这种做法我们这边也不允许。  \n这是765事务所的意见，也是全体的决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b3aff427e81e75665623a5745ba46f566487918b778b9089796c1af641fdf342", "ja": "ドッキリで行くというのであれば、\n馬場だけでなく、他のアイドルも出演させられません。", "zh": "如果要采用整蛊方案，那就不能只让马场出演，其他偶像也不能参加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c678a88cf3c4d365546de7f9f94570cb4a9ea411e24e9576d96569f89e387dfe", "ja": "すみませんが、この企画は再考して頂けますか？\nそれでは、失礼します。", "zh": "不好意思，能请您重新考虑一下这个企划吗？\n那么，我先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "5418f511ad4fbac39381b2eeeca9aaeb8bb09fecf94c5c32ae210500b24cc70a", "ja": "……結局、{$P$}に全部\n何とかしてもらっちゃったわね。", "zh": "……结果，最后还是全靠{$P$}\n替我搞定了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "d2f1bb17f835769f1d82bd95c54416998b08c0f6cd88e81681dab3aa30599f79", "ja": "お姉さんにまかせなさい！なんて言ってたのに……\n不甲斐ないわね、私。", "zh": "明明还说过“交给姐姐吧！”……\n真是没用啊，我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1028_p", "source_sha256": "6f6391f46298fa7c3db864dd08df8d93717df0102da84bd6437c2e78d96aa3c7", "ja": "こちらこそ……\n最初からコントロールできずすみません。", "zh": "我这边才是……\n一开始就没能控制住局面，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c48193172bd6df04d9d912bffd029d93ed5d64d0d32d9e04711706d7b80435a6", "ja": "それに、ああいう要求をしてきたら\n最初から断るつもりでいたんです。", "zh": "而且，要是对方提出那种要求，我本来就打算从一开始拒绝的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1030_p", "source_sha256": "15885c0ce42a4b9e5ae913d97323fba8b483eefaf9c334dbb790810985abe189", "ja": "なので、このみさんに責任はありません。\nこのみさん以外のアイドルでも、同じです。断ります。", "zh": "所以，这不是このみ小姐的责任。\n换作其他偶像也是一样。我会拒绝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "c64c261118603f7662b225082a8e81d9c4564f8bc3d0cba6f015101098f2c86c", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nそうよね。ありがとう。", "zh": "{$P$}……。\n是啊。谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1032_p", "source_sha256": "08688de2c4f39af07cc1c046d03b9be553b637ea294c9b7218237e92067ed59d", "ja": "それより、このみさんこそ大丈夫ですか？\n仕事がしたいって言ってたのに、すみません。", "zh": "话说回来，倒是您还好吗，小此木小姐？\n明明您说过想工作的，真是对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "5fcfdf2ccf909ea25ec60869c1fcc6b21ff7fd7ce282f85913cdc9adfb875a28", "ja": "私なら大丈夫！　それより、もし仕事が来なくなっても\n気にしちゃダメよ、{$P$}！", "zh": "我没事！不过，就算之后没有工作找上门来，{$P$}你也千万别放在心上哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "e80500dea8729626696eceef03e5de6123aa48bb6549d4184b9e402586ce3852", "ja": "だってさっきの{$P$}、\nとってもカッコよかったもの。頼もしかったわ。", "zh": "因为刚才的{$P$}，真的帅极了。让人觉得很可靠呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1035_p", "source_sha256": "e5726121ffd277d18cff7bbcf9dd151b34ef6f1dd5f07bbf80fd89c3d922a150", "ja": "そうですか。\nそれならいいんですけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。那就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1036_p", "source_sha256": "b3ccc7d6eb6995fa5b34281cc20afd4c818eedf3135be43d7c8c1cffe333cac4", "ja": "このみさん、明日はお休みですよね。\n家まで送りますから、ゆっくり休んでください。", "zh": "好啦，原来如此。\n那就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "4351d9fcd8605f15d9ea45785c55732c4af8f52e83ea606f611f87c6efdac879", "ja": "ええ、ありがと♪　それじゃ、いつもの……\n家の近くの、スーパーの前で降ろしてもらえる？", "zh": "嗯，谢谢你♪ 那就像平时一样……\n可以在我家附近的超市前让我下车吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1038_p", "source_sha256": "c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95", "ja": "わかりました。", "zh": "好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1040_039kon", "source_sha256": "dc2c6b879eed897e5870489f76390db641ac75ee1beaacdbcb66ffa8044a755a", "ja": "またやっちゃった……{$P$}は\n心配してくれたのに。ホント馬鹿ね、私……。", "zh": "我又搞砸了……{$P$}明明还在担心我。真是个笨蛋，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1041_039kon", "source_sha256": "8cb7bff6c90da773bfc94e79ee54c6f9f2b86a162c1dedae24316abd8c7efd71", "ja": "落ち込んでばっかりもいられないわね。明日は\nお休みだし、ちょっと贅沢に家飲みしちゃおうかしら。", "zh": "也不能一直这么消沉下去呢。明天又休息，今晚要不要奢侈一把，在家喝点酒呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1042_karin", "source_sha256": "3f302cc6fddd403b78284c142138ea6697bd2f75e085c8b2a86e8a96ac17ee99", "ja": "えーっと……あ、いたいた。\nおねーちゃーん！", "zh": "呃……啊，找到了找到了。\n姐姐——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1043_039kon", "source_sha256": "6ec52c83c7cd28ff64e2264d91da9e662d5a3a3917ebe2b150d4810705fe0cc5", "ja": "え？　こ、この声は……\nかりん！？", "zh": "咦？这、这个声音是……\n花梨！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1044_039kon", "source_sha256": "4091935bb947f3056159674667c693feee6f63afa9e6b1e826b3af326e88d3ce", "ja": "かりん、あんた\nどうしてこんなところにいるのよ。", "zh": "可怜，你怎么会在这种地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1045_karin", "source_sha256": "6598ff4f0f709c71f5c8712ef498a814afb6b231c243f1fbe8d8e168c7a90a7f", "ja": "どうしてって、遊びに来ただけ。ついでに、\nお姉ちゃんにお土産買ってこうかと思って。", "zh": "你问为什么？我只是来玩的。顺便想给姐姐买点伴手礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1046_karin", "source_sha256": "84ff265dfb0dc7339302d3e8b5b9502dd4c46c975c76beea48812b123588f52a", "ja": "このビールあげるから、今晩泊めて♪", "zh": "我把这瓶啤酒给你，今晚让我借住一晚吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1047_039kon", "source_sha256": "b5c4ccaed863bcc2541097583469e56ae027f16415923e4ec2db9a170ef75f44", "ja": "まったく、いつも突然なんだから……。\nそれで、お酒のアテは？　何が食べたいの？", "zh": "真是的，每次都这么突然……\n所以，下酒菜呢？想吃点什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1048_karin", "source_sha256": "1411c6ad02f315ca17f44c16579a5267e39719ddad576bc76b550642a42a4877", "ja": "えへへ、お姉ちゃんだーいすき！\nあのね、お姉ちゃんの作る卵焼きが食べたいな♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，我最喜欢姐姐了！\n那个呀，我想吃姐姐做的玉子烧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1049_karin", "source_sha256": "7fe3a5a8f6440f08e5b08520a8bc30b1d5d17724691a3751bab3d8d5c8348acf", "ja": "あ、ネギも入れてね！", "zh": "啊，也放点大葱进去哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1050_039kon", "source_sha256": "17bd7c3993d75f3f8c70a124111a1c798471336a611f2171bb41759a8a0e9824", "ja": "はいはい。\nそれじゃ、卵も買わなくちゃね。", "zh": "好啦好啦。\n那么，鸡蛋也得买才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1051_039kon", "source_sha256": "e575a1fd84b3f73fa5177c2f0e0b28f45e12968d2d569197783ab2db502894c8", "ja": "だからぁ、それでぇ……ヒック。\n{$P$}が仕事、断っちゃったの……。", "zh": "所以嘛，然后嘛……嗝。{$P$}拒绝了工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1052_karin", "source_sha256": "98527895f0d5eea395b6f34c379c13cb44aa15ffa83c462abbd0d8c5f7ca528e", "ja": "へー、そうなんだ。{$P$}さんて\n優しそうな感じしたのに、結構ハッキリ言うんだね。", "zh": "哦，原来如此。明明觉得{$P$}先生给人的感觉很温柔，没想到说话还挺直接的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1053_karin", "source_sha256": "340287ca54434331e5d3a7f4a743a0bf63b4f7e9ef9fba30cbdbea7f714bde49", "ja": "でもお姉ちゃん、その仕事したくなかったんでしょ？\nなら、落ち込む必要ないじゃない。", "zh": "可是姐姐，你本来就不想做那份工作吧？  \n那就没必要沮丧了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1054_039kon", "source_sha256": "4c223a5508e1f4e2624356ee921518292dbf083508a5003340cf524dfcf9744e", "ja": "そうらけどぉ……ヒック。\n乙女心は、複雑なのよぉ……。", "zh": "是这样没错，可是……呜呜。\n女孩子的心思可是很复杂的呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1055_039kon", "source_sha256": "19227f6292f4239dc415166f349853b03c42b00bef7712bbdf278b0741e533c5", "ja": "やりたくないし、みんなにもさせたくないけど……。\nでも、有名な番組なんだもの……。", "zh": "我不想做，也不想让大家做……  \n可是，那可是知名节目啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1056_039kon", "source_sha256": "71f91d0f90641ed76017061a2f83715debf4de059a0cfb5b48a64483291d0f86", "ja": "私も、みんなも……これが、何かの\nチャンスに繋がったかもって、思うじゃない……。", "zh": "我也好，大家也好……都会觉得，说不定这会成为某种机会吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1057_karin", "source_sha256": "787f90fe728e9a30e312dedb1a71fed237cedfb18e248fec71e152144d310597", "ja": "断ったのは、{$P$}さんでしょ？\nお姉ちゃんが気にすることないのに。", "zh": "拒绝的明明是{$P$}先生吧？\n姐姐根本不用介意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1058_039kon", "source_sha256": "15974bba36cb26c49de815e4dce360e33de6cd1aaff57a3d141edaa7349da445", "ja": "も～、そういうワケにはいかないの！\nお仕事だし、それに私は、お姉さんだし……。", "zh": "真是的～，那可不行！\n毕竟是工作，而且我还是姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1059_039kon", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1060_karin", "source_sha256": "6af5adb975acc189cd59a82c2ac29955a406fff0285509214c1fb0c6511cb091", "ja": "……お姉ちゃん？\nどうしたの？　人の顔じっと見て……。", "zh": "……姐姐？\n怎么了吗？一直盯着人家的脸看……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1061_039kon", "source_sha256": "56c2129566417d35804d04eab47207d43c6d15a807430c5f906b88429e19f7b2", "ja": "……いいなぁ。", "zh": "……真好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1062_karin", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1063_039kon", "source_sha256": "b7b716be312b39146ab19ed7661684c35a78484e661d07f01fbb9d8d1f940b19", "ja": "私も、かりんみたいだったら良かったなぁって……。\nそうしたら、こんな愚痴言わなくてよかったのに……。", "zh": "我也想着，要是能像花凛那样就好了……那样的话，也不用说这些牢骚了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1064_karin", "source_sha256": "8d9a4394e90f62a67501d43a513991f0656e4e17f2a9a6118cfc8b892d6c6b0e", "ja": "お姉ちゃん……。", "zh": "姐姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1065_karin", "source_sha256": "8023faf1200312e1ee9ed0af60cfaf67550be6fc6c982bcd97da91507c78587f", "ja": "……でも、お姉ちゃんが私みたいだったら、\nアイドルにはなってないんじゃない？", "zh": "……不过，如果姐姐和我一样的话，\n应该就不会成为偶像了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1066_039kon", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1067_karin", "source_sha256": "78c90d9244b9007ba6ae3dca7ef84e6704d3a4126293b5ff020be70dc0418533", "ja": "私は、アイドルになろうなんて思ったことないし。\nもし今スカウトされても、絶対なれないよ。怖いもん。", "zh": "我从来没想过要当偶像。\n就算现在有人来挖掘我，我也绝对当不了。因为很可怕嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1068_karin", "source_sha256": "8202cca0f6428ad0cc668c19f6a7b5628b36f953ecec381d2710590beb5fc4e6", "ja": "お姉ちゃんはすごいよね。仕事辞めたと思ったら、\nたったひとりで、芸能界になんて飛び込んじゃって。", "zh": "姐姐真厉害呢。刚以为她辞掉了工作，没想到竟然一个人闯进了演艺圈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1069_karin", "source_sha256": "0870e70a82bdc0165bd3c1643dcc237fd343ed8d9ab574420bad67232960cf6c", "ja": "すごく、勇気があるなぁって思うよ。\nお姉ちゃんのそういうところ、尊敬してる。", "zh": "我觉得姐姐真的很有勇气。\n我很尊敬姐姐这样的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1070_039kon", "source_sha256": "e5f8d7eba887d8acf6815719d8c7be3a32310c692c110385c252b54e592753dc", "ja": "かりん……。", "zh": "可怜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1071_karin", "source_sha256": "2f30ba54f0179f5c77eb65feb9f37717bea6be5a06fb7d296e9898ec0fd9de9a", "ja": "それより、目が覚めたならその辺で寝ないで。\n片付けは明日でいいから、ちゃんとお布団入って寝よ！", "zh": "话说，既然醒了就别在那附近睡着了。\n收拾的事明天再做也行，先好好进被窝睡吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1072_039kon", "source_sha256": "42c46d516a2f2fcedeec47367c989ec5e069580037547f4f7575b59da2fc9e0d", "ja": "え、ええ。\n……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1073_karin", "source_sha256": "3761a114405ec6e6fb03a50927a054bd949e255c5776535db9279e146488c9e0", "ja": "……。\nお姉ちゃん、寝ちゃった？", "zh": "……\n姐姐，睡着了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1074_039kon", "source_sha256": "ab3c1da7b5aa85e6441a9821de2b16794fa5feddd440aac02b55de6dfe41ab66", "ja": "まだ起きてるわよ。\n……どうかしたの？", "zh": "我还醒着呢。\n……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1075_karin", "source_sha256": "c8b121ee5c01b812b3c6547254196dbc8437e5d682c91f5c78add53e88574800", "ja": "あのね……初めて、お姉ちゃんが\nアイドルになるって聞いた時、思ったんだ。", "zh": "那个……第一次听说姐姐要成为偶像时，我就在想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1076_karin", "source_sha256": "6e9bb648bfc6508459ce9bdd302610cb95d3df58c9ccc9d322e8c8407c8412e6", "ja": "私の可愛いお姉ちゃんが、アイドルになって、\n大勢の人に知られちゃったら……。", "zh": "要是我可爱的姐姐成为偶像，\n被很多人知道了的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1078_karin", "source_sha256": "ab3e23bf8c2d4272b760ec3529928a135ce5aa372bc5d5442eda2ef530399799", "ja": "私だけのお姉ちゃんじゃなくなっちゃうのかな、って\n心配した事もあったけど……。", "zh": "我也曾担心过，姐姐是不是就不再只属于我一个人了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1079_karin", "source_sha256": "f77db6b86a00364fc71cce6080ca5569bbd0e31c5c963918f45faf8e109dc21c", "ja": "でも、安心した。お姉ちゃん変わらないね。", "zh": "不过，放心了。姐姐还是没变呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1080_039kon", "source_sha256": "f6c34e5590d51bbc8bf0bad873640508fe2989acf9d19a40c12a1dd802d56444", "ja": "……当たり前でしょ。", "zh": "……那当然啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1081_karin", "source_sha256": "f839693f12ba1adf2dedae7a97f31f1613ff5e59622bddcb237c4ec05cda354d", "ja": "お姉ちゃんはずっと、私の自慢のお姉ちゃんだよ。", "zh": "姐姐一直都是我引以为傲的姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1082_039kon", "source_sha256": "b716739e2e30526580681e93f865a8ae95548caca9356289eb96cf49b1db482a", "ja": "……もう、バカね。", "zh": "……真是的，傻瓜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1083_karin", "source_sha256": "2554ab683d45202054fc4fb4ef2201e974125b359b14faf4e5bd43880511e70f", "ja": "ふふふ。", "zh": "呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1084_039kon", "source_sha256": "f473d3ccc20edb0948f9030c57d171ae5183e3c427b063918dc453d6c167b1b5", "ja": "……ねえ、かりん。もしかして、\n{$P$}から何か聞いた？", "zh": "……我说，花梨。难道说，\n你从{$P$}那里听说了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1085_karin", "source_sha256": "706caf3ca1e6b7610ea975eec701354a1d7bbbe7d6d36479e79f27e91ba11d8b", "ja": "さあ、どうでしょう。", "zh": "那么，怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1086_039kon", "source_sha256": "d15fcd00e7e3976085b809179e6ba013971752fa991ea4b12d8b084dfa511383", "ja": "もう……。", "zh": "真是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1087_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1088_p", "source_sha256": "2656021906b2a74551144fabb717d88accc85b7f177e9cb4e54ff1fd92899811", "ja": "（例の番組からまた連絡があった。事務所と\nこのみさんに、お詫びと相談があるとの事だけど……）", "zh": "（那个节目又联系过来了。听说是要向事务所和这个美小姐道歉，并商量一些事情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1089_newdirector", "source_sha256": "236aad3ac68c9b80518257a872d35f0f784064f4b4be96564ca8ad1d138887fe", "ja": "先日は大変失礼いたしました。企画担当を\n一新しましたので、改めてよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "前些日子实在非常失礼。企划负责人已经全面更换，今后还请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1090_newdirector", "source_sha256": "c4a3f2da01442bd1ed906b66d12dae3b8bb72a1dbf29f889d3aca0303a7593fb", "ja": "実は、うちも視聴率が低迷していまして……それで\n企画担当が、過激な方向に走りがちだったようです。", "zh": "其实我们台的收视率也一直很低迷……所以企划负责人似乎容易走向过激的方向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1091_p", "source_sha256": "8e7e894186e1ec986bae30b57478f5525d57a188556bf35ba81ae1dbdde9fe15", "ja": "そうでしたか。\nそれで、折り入って相談というのは……？", "zh": "原来是这样。\n那么，您特意来找我是想商量……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1092_newdirector", "source_sha256": "bac00ffff51dee9517376c5d90653a552bcf7fdc3760ef4f1b19e7c8b7c6d561", "ja": "前回の放送は、そちらが仰るとおりの評価でした。\nそこで、改めてご意見をお伺いしたいんです。", "zh": "上次播出的节目，评价确实如您所说。\n所以，我想再次听听您的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1093_newdirector", "source_sha256": "4c94303874b27e8a311a2e9edd270419e82dedcedbf3a7710910cead115f5946", "ja": "765プロさんは大勢の女性アイドルを抱えていて、\n老若男女ファンが多い。その理由を知りたいのです。", "zh": "765事务所旗下拥有许多女性偶像，\n而且男女老少的粉丝都很多。我想知道其中的原因。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1094_newdirector", "source_sha256": "b49271f7eac1f85300cfb6d33d5d54eaa2f64cbf688f91754d9c78df47674d66", "ja": "それが、うちの番組作りのヒントになる気がして……。", "zh": "我觉得那或许能成为我们制作节目的灵感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1095_039kon", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1096_p", "source_sha256": "eb09a1f95dda533ee5d7821027c3a98a86c35e6bcbbcbd83fd27bce561c5703e", "ja": "このみさん、どうかしましたか？\n意見があるなら、遠慮なく言ってくださいね。", "zh": "这个美小姐，怎么了吗？\n如果有什么意见，请尽管说出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1097_039kon", "source_sha256": "b0d983aebb97b7f3277f3e52a1f278fb0a8e79aa769001ec975781f14d080d57", "ja": "え、ええ。……あの、こちらの番組の、昔の放送を\n見たことがあって……。密着取材とか、どうでしょう？", "zh": "呃、嗯。……那个，我以前看过这个节目的往期节目……要不要做个跟拍采访？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1098_039kon", "source_sha256": "0dd38cbe980df4150db87e5a0a6260c332318d4912fde16f4384149f65e9d71c", "ja": "どうせなら、撮影しながら私たちのことを\n知ってもらったほうがいいんじゃないかって。", "zh": "既然如此，不如一边拍摄一边让大家了解我们，您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1099_p", "source_sha256": "992e1d03096fd5e3d203286c7928f0ddb20039bbad340e9bc5ba822b56bffa8d", "ja": "事務所と番組、双方の考え方も見せられますし、\nいいアイディアかもしれませんね。", "zh": "也能让大家看到事务所和节目的想法，或许是个不错的主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1100_newdirector", "source_sha256": "b6d91ac81bfca887d664870f4ea1312cf7133a359a073ea39e522a4c4f66bea1", "ja": "なるほど、密着取材……\nお互い、Win-Winというわけですね。", "zh": "原来如此，贴身采访……\n也就是说，这是互利共赢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1101_newdirector", "source_sha256": "3e08c1a05892c51c17ceb507620b7f98fe738ba552ef7bf1b5cfabd8a13ff7c6", "ja": "ではその方向で企画を立ててみます。\nその代わり、密着が厳しくても覚悟してくださいね！", "zh": "那我就按这个方向策划看看。\n作为交换，就算是紧贴拍摄很辛苦，也请做好心理准备哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1102_039kon", "source_sha256": "7881377135d143c61afc46699e61495a379fc8cea041095b3fab4d781f5df6a3", "ja": "ウフフ、それならまかせてください！\nアイドルは、見られることに慣れっこですから。", "zh": "呵呵，那就交给我吧！\n偶像早就习惯被人注视了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1103_039kon", "source_sha256": "33a4b24c3360d46036d64f7dd2fb6f47f5d6849ceb88f56b8b110b5787c2615b", "ja": "それに、どうせやるなら……\n私たちにしかできないコト、やってやりましょう！", "zh": "而且，既然要做的话……  \n就来做只有我们才能做到的事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_143_1104_p", "source_sha256": "479090cd5eaa09cb282d3ffc27571eabeae99941c3e98a5821184ab39a64b5f5", "ja": "（このみさんの表情に、いつもの明るさが戻った。\n……もう、大丈夫だな）", "zh": "（琴美脸上恢复了平时的开朗。……已经没事了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
